title: Francina Armengol
is-pinned-card: true
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: sanchez_leader = 1 and adv_armengol = 1
new-page: true

= Francina Armengol

President of the Balearic Islands, from the left of the barons.

- @fa_bal
- @fa_tour
- @fa_lang
- @root: Back

@fa_bal
title: The Balearic left
subtitle: Podemos and Més relations improve.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.rel_up += 5; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

Armengol governs with Podemos and the nationalists.

@fa_tour
title: A tourism tax
subtitle: In government: the deficit falls a little; the self-employed grumble.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and player_in_government = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?] Only in government.
on-arrival: {! Q.fiscal_adj += 0.05; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.campaign(Q, 'psoe', {self_employed: -0.3}); } Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

Every visitor pays a little for the islands.

@fa_lang
title: Catalan-speaking Spain
subtitle: More Catalan dialogue.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and catalan_crisis = 1 and hard_unionist = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?] Needs the Catalan crisis under way, and a Sánchez who is not a hard-line unionist.
on-arrival: {! Q.cat_dialogue = (Q.cat_dialogue || 0) + 1; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

Armengol defends the islands' language and their place in Spain.

