@montero
title: María Jesús Montero
is-pinned-card: true
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: sanchez_leader = 1 and min_finance = 1
new-page: true

= María Jesús Montero

Minister of Finance. Sevillian, fast-talking, and the person who knows where every euro goes. Faction: Regional barons.

- @montero_tighten
- @montero_regions
- @montero_partners
- @root: Back

@montero_tighten
title: Tighten spending
subtitle: Lowers the deficit and pleases Brussels; the unions object.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; Q.fiscal_adj -= 0.3; Q.trade_unionists_dissent += 5; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.intl(Q, 'eu', 3); window.SpainGame.econ(Q, -0.1, 0.05); window.SpainGame.social(Q, -1); } !}

A spending freeze in every ministry but pensions.

@montero_regions
title: Renegotiate regional financing
subtitle: Calms the barons; costs money.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: regional_leaders_dissent -= 8; fiscal_adj += 0.1; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

Every region gets a little more. None of them thinks it is enough, but all of them take it.

@montero_partners
title: Sound out the budget partners
subtitle: Better relations with the PNV and ERC.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: rel_pnv += 5; rel_erc += 5; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

Investments for the Basque Country, a commission for Catalonia. The budget arithmetic improves.

@abalos
title: José Luis Ábalos
is-pinned-card: true
