new-page: true

= José Luis Ábalos

The Valencian deputy who was with you before anyone else, and who will be with you whatever happens: in Ferraz, on the backbenches, or on the road. [? if year >= 2017 : Secretary of Organisation since your return. ?] He does not count against the three advisers you can keep.

- @org_tour
- @org_money
- @org_disc
- @abalos_road
- @root: Back

@abalos_road
title: Work the phones for you
subtitle: Your network and following grow.
view-if: sanchez_leader = 0
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.network = (Q.network || 0) + 6; Q.sanchismo += 3; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

Ábalos spends a month calling every secretary of every local branch who ever shook your hand.

@deputy_pm
title: Deputy Prime Minister
is-pinned-card: true
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: adv_deputy = 1
new-page: true

= [+ adv_deputy_name +], Deputy Prime Minister

[? if adv_deputy_partner = 1 : Your coalition partner's leader sits at your right hand in the Council of Ministers. Everything you agree with them, their party will vote for; everything you do not, the press will hear about. ?][? if adv_deputy_partner = 0 : Your deputy runs the government's day-to-day business and coordinates the ministries. ?] The government's posts do not count against your three advisers.

- @dep_coord
- @dep_partner
- @root: Back

@dep_coord
title: Coordinate the ministries
subtitle: More authority; the government looks competent.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.sanchez_authority += 4; Q.institutionalists_dissent -= 3; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

A month without leaks between ministries.

@dep_partner
title: Settle a dispute with the partner
view-if: adv_deputy_partner = 1
subtitle: Better relations with the coalition partner.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! var k = 'rel_' + Q.adv_deputy_party; Q[k] = (Q[k] || 40) + 8; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

A long dinner in the Moncloa ends the week's quarrel.

