Investment is brought forward.

@pm_adviser
title: The Prime Minister
is-pinned-card: true
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: adv_pm = 1
new-page: true

= [+ adv_pm_name +], Prime Minister

You are the junior partner: the Prime Minister is not your adviser so much as your counterpart, and the person whose good will decides what your ministers can do.

- @pm_ask
- @root: Back

@pm_ask
title: Ask for a concession
subtitle: Your following grows; relations with the Prime Minister's party cool.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! var k = 'rel_' + Q.pm_party; Q[k] = (Q[k] || 40) - 4; Q.sanchismo += 4; Q.member_morale += 2; Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; !}

You get it, and the Prime Minister remembers that you asked.

@team
title: Your team
is-pinned-card: true
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: sanchez_leader = 1
new-page: true

= Your team

You can keep up to three advisers at a time (now **[+ adv_count +]**). People offer their services as the factions come round to you; a faction that turns against you takes its people with it. José Luis Ábalos, your permanent loyalist, and the government's ministers do not count.

**Institutionalists** ([+ fmood_institutionalists_word +]): [? if adv_offer_hernando = 1 : Antonio Hernando[? if adv_hernando = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_calvo = 1 : Carmen Calvo[? if adv_calvo = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_robles = 1 : Margarita Robles[? if adv_robles = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_simancas = 1 : Rafael Simancas[? if adv_simancas = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if fac_offers_institutionalists = 0 : nobody has come forward yet. ?]

**Modernisers** ([+ fmood_modernisers_word +]): [? if adv_offer_redondo = 1 : Iván Redondo[? if adv_redondo = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_sevilla = 1 : Jordi Sevilla[? if adv_sevilla = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_escudero = 1 : Manuel Escudero[? if adv_escudero = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_madina = 1 : Eduardo Madina[? if adv_madina = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if fac_offers_modernisers = 0 : nobody has come forward yet. ?]

**Socialist Left** ([+ fmood_progressives_word +]): [? if adv_offer_lastra = 1 : Adriana Lastra[? if adv_lastra = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_tapias = 1 : José Antonio Pérez Tapias[? if adv_tapias = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_elorza = 1 : Odón Elorza[? if adv_elorza = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_cantera = 1 : Zaida Cantera[? if adv_cantera = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if fac_offers_progressives = 0 : nobody has come forward yet. ?]

**Sanchistas** ([+ fmood_sanchistas_word +]): [? if adv_offer_luena = 1 : César Luena[? if adv_luena = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_cerdan = 1 : Santos Cerdán[? if adv_cerdan = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_puente = 1 : Óscar Puente[? if adv_puente = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_bolanos = 1 : Félix Bolaños[? if adv_bolanos = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if fac_offers_sanchistas = 0 : nobody has come forward yet. ?]

**Trade Unionists** ([+ fmood_trade_unionists_word +]): [? if adv_offer_ferrer = 1 : Toni Ferrer[? if adv_ferrer = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_mendez = 1 : Cándido Méndez[? if adv_mendez = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_valerio = 1 : Magdalena Valerio[? if adv_valerio = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_alvarez = 1 : Pepe Álvarez[? if adv_alvarez = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if fac_offers_trade_unionists = 0 : nobody has come forward yet. ?]

**Regional Barons** ([+ fmood_regional_leaders_word +]): [? if adv_offer_puig = 1 : Ximo Puig[? if adv_puig = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_vara = 1 : Guillermo Fernández Vara[? if adv_vara = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_lamban = 1 : Javier Lambán[? if adv_lamban = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if adv_offer_armengol = 1 : Francina Armengol[? if adv_armengol = 1 : , on your team ?]. ?][? if fac_offers_regional_leaders = 0 : nobody has come forward yet. ?]

