@fwarm_institutionalists
title: The Old Guard Accepts Sánchez
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: fevent_institutionalists = 1
max-visits: 99
on-arrival: fevent_institutionalists = 0

= The Old Guard Accepts Sánchez

The Institutionalists now count you as one of theirs. Their best people let it be known that they are available: [+ fwarm_names_institutionalists +]. You will find them on your team card.

@fcold_institutionalists
title: The Old Guard Turns on Sánchez
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: fevent_institutionalists = -1
max-visits: 99
on-arrival: fevent_institutionalists = 0

= The Old Guard Turns on Sánchez

The Institutionalists have had enough of you. Their people will not serve, and any of them on your team leave it.[? if fcold_left_institutionalists = 1 : A resignation letter is already on your desk. ?]

