@offer
title: An offer of service
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: offer_pending = 1
max-visits: 99
on-arrival: offer_pending = 0

= [+ offer_name +] offers their service

[+ offer_name +] lets it be known, through a friend in Ferraz, that they would like to work with you. You can bring them in from your team card.

- @offer_take: Bring them in now
- @root: Thank them; perhaps later

@offer_take
title: Welcome aboard
choose-if: adv_count < 3
unavailable-subtitle: Your team is full: let someone go first.
on-arrival: {! if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.hireAdviser(Q, Q.offer_id); } !}

[+ offer_name +] joins your team.
